    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hurry, hide!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I need to go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take this... this is for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a protective charm. My mother taught me how to make these...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "And this is one that I made.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "When you make these dolls by hand, you can keep the ones you care about safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay, sister Misha, we'll take good care of it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Children"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_012_misa_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, go hide! And don't make a sound.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Misha"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Children"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where'd they go? ! After them! Let's see how far those Infected can run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm? Now... what do we have here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "initr": 2,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "According to Exusiai's data, our mission target should have been staying somewhere around here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Argh, the terrain around here is really complicated. If we were doing this alone, this assignment might have been quite troublesome...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Luckily, I got in touch with Penguin Logistics beforehand...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Who's there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Those people are...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Baddies! You bunch of baddies! Let go of me! Let... Go...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me! Where'd she run off to?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop playing dumb!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister! Sister! Where are you...! Help...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sister Misha! Sister Misha, save me!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Who is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get back here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "...You should leave right now if you know what's good for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who the hell...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You don't like you're from around here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not afraid of us...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_skill_spiritexplo",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Otherwise...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gaaah!!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-what was that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arts! Sh-she's using Arts?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaargh! Stay away from me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "block": true,
        "fadetime": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Don't bully the defenseless ever again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 3,
        "ystrength": 4,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaagh! Monster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rioter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_soldiersrun",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 5,
        "ystrength": 6,
        "vibrato": 90,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh... Monster, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything will be okay. You can come out now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's dangerous here. You should hurry and find some place safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you, ma'am!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Children"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take care!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, what's going on?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm, I saw an Infected just now, probably unregistered...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "From Ursus?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. She was heading deeper into the slums.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Franka, gather the nearby operators.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The deeper we head into the slums, the more volatile things are going to be...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "There are ordinary civilians, criminals, and refugees - all mixed together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll have to make thorough preparations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, we have incoming comms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please wait a second.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, it's the L.G.D.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Was that Madam Ch'en?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Indeed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "... That's right. We've already found a number of unregistered Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Yes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "... What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "... We're after an Ursus girl, short white hair, height of about 145 cm, called Misha?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Madam Ch'en wants us to immediately search for the Infected just described.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Once we find her, we are to turn her in to the L.G.D. immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I speak to her please?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hello, hello...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madam Ch'en, can you hear me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "style": "cutin",
        "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "offsetx": -300,
        "width": 200,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I confirm the validity of that order?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "100% valid, effective immediately.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "charactercutin",
        "widgetID": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "She suddenly hung up...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Ch'en, she's got a bit of a temper.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "So this is going to be our mission for now...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, I've just received another message from several defenders.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "They met some individuals who were openly hostile to Rhodes Island's operators.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "text": "Furthermore, those attackers weren't ordinary people, they were... Infected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "... Have the defenders fall back towards us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Scout team! Our target is an Ursine girl with short white hair, height of 145 cm. Remember to stay hidden, and stay safe!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Other operators, follow your leaders and spread out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "It'd be best to stall them out.;So we're... going to lure them in?;Franka, let's attack them head-on.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey... Not bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Liskarm, this kid's pretty smart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "... Dr. {@nickname} is our tactical commander. You should take this more seriously.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's begin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "So... Rhodes Island has to fight against the Infected again...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "image"
    }
]